 "card": "Logs the resolved canonical target of the data directory during node startup if it differs from the specified path, such as when using symlinks. This ensures debug.log captures the physical storage location used during a run. The author notes this assists developers benchmarking across multiple storage devices where modifying startup flags is constrained. There are no dependencies.",
